> Is it possible to get the source codes for your webapps so I can study them?

Sure; the source code for opencpu is on
https://github.com/jeroenooms/opencpu. It has a function called
'rapachehandler' which is where you should start from rapache.

Source code for all of the opencpu web applications are on
